  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TTest1
  @  One-sample t test: is a sample mean compatible with a reference value?
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "TTest1: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → nv xbv sdv muv « nv 0 + xbv 0 + sdv 0 + muv 0 + → nn xb sd mu0 « '(xb-mu0)/(sd/√(nn))' →Num 'nn-1' →Num → tv dfv « tv "t" →Tag dfv "df" →Tag dfv 'ABS(tv)' →Num UTPT 2 * "p" →Tag nv xbv sdv muv 4 →List Drop » » »
